WEBVTT

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:34.990
Suigin Becomes the Last Tomb Guardian!

00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:45.540
What the heck? Apparently he's all show.

00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:46.750
Okay, then...

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:56.890
<i>Tomb guardians and tomb raiders...</i>

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:05.290
<i>They have fought over the 
Goddess's tomb for 1,000 years.</i>

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:12.350
<i>But originally, both sides had 
the same special powers.</i>

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:14.500
How did we...

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:15.700
...end up in this mess, star?!

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:17.700
Charge complete.

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:20.490
Fire!

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:37.640
The left leg's been damaged!

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:39.380
We're finished, star!

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:41.480
Young Master, at this rate...

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:44.720
There has to be...

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:47.690
This is it!

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:49.890
Let's take out the 
long-range cannon first!

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:52.860
Right, Young Master.

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:54.440
Oh?

00:02:57.700 --> 00:03:00.830
<i>To counter the tomb raiders who destroy tombs</i>

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:03.330
<i>to take the power of the gods as their own...</i>

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:09.240
What is that? It's huge!

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:16.030
<i>We protect the tombs, the power that 
lies within them, and the world...</i>

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:18.680
<i>That is our duty as tomb guardians.</i>

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:25.440
There they are.

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:28.530
You don't need to rush. 
Just aim carefully!

00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:31.590
Yes, Young Master.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:37.320
<i>But over time, the number of tomb 
guardians continued to decline...</i>

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:39.340
<i>And now...</i>

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:53.050
What the heck? I already 
have to charge again?

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:54.840
Calm down, calm down.

00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:56.790
I thought I had it...

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:19.110
I guess you can't expect anything 
less from a guardian's weapon.

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:21.120
It sure packs a punch.

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:25.280
That really was close.

00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:29.500
What are you so freaked out for?

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:32.160
I-I-I'm not freaked out!

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:34.240
Damn it! Now I'm pissed!

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:38.170
Now I'm just going to use the 
ultimate mode to get them!

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:39.590
Just watch!

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:42.480
Well, we'll just have to make sure

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:45.810
we make them pay for coming after us.

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:58.270
Shostia?

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:02.540
The club... I have to shoot the club...

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:05.420
Here we go!

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:18.380
Go! Go! Go!

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:27.990
Shooting energy has been lowered.

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:30.240
Only one desert eagle round left.

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:32.910
What are you doing, star?

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:33.690
Oh, dear.

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:36.060
Hey, what's wrong, Shostia?!

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:35.440
Wh-What's wrong, twin?

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:37.130
Are you okay, star?

00:05:37.130 --> 00:05:40.970
Help me out, you two! Shostia's...

00:05:40.970 --> 00:05:44.240
It appears to be hypnosis.

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:51.450
It's working!

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:57.260
The armor's been destroyed, twin.

00:05:57.260 --> 00:06:00.290
The enemy's familiar has 
infiltrated our vessel, star.

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:08.410
G-Gramps!

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:11.480
Farin

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:11.120
Push the button.

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:11.480
Calling

00:06:11.820 --> 00:06:13.460
Farin-chan?

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:16.820
Eeyuu's going to let off a huge one soon,

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:18.530
so now would be a good time to take cover.

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:20.700
Just you wait.

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:25.050
Don't come in, twin!

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:26.940
We're finished, star!

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:30.050
The club... The club...

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:34.440
Gramps! What's wrong, Gramps!

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:39.700
Oh, it's nothing. Just my saved 
data is starting to disappear...

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:41.710
There's no need to be sad.

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:46.210
Listen well, Suigin.

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:49.470
Protect Bango's tomb.

00:06:50.350 --> 00:06:52.270
That will also result...

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:56.190
in saving Riku Rei.

00:06:57.200 --> 00:07:02.900
You are the last of us tomb guardians.

00:07:07.980 --> 00:07:10.770
You are the last guardian.

00:07:16.610 --> 00:07:18.250
Gramps!

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:21.740
My Gramps...

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:30.370
Gonna retreat now.

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:40.060
What's that?

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:41.350
Huh?

00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:45.720
Another player? Of course 
there isn't another one.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.460
That must be him...

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:54.940
The club... The club...

00:07:55.150 --> 00:07:57.120
I have to shoot the club...

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:01.410
Now!

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:08.800
It's fast!

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:10.920
To think that I can't catch up to it...

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:14.800
Wh-Why?

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:26.960
N-No way!

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:33.360
Nee-san!

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:41.630
Phoebe-neesan...

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:46.100
Who the hell are you?

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:52.160
A-Are you...

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:58.070
No way... I thought all the tomb guardians 
disappeared a long time ago...

00:08:58.870 --> 00:09:01.590
Well, there's one right here.

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:05.510
The last tomb guardian.

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:12.910
Damn it!

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:16.870
Disappear!

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:24.430
What the?!

00:09:28.270 --> 00:09:30.890
I'm counting on you, Suigin.

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:41.640
Does this end the exam?

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:42.900
Yes.

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:45.860
Because you defeated the tomb raiders,

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:49.190
you have been acknowledged as a 
tomb guardian, Young Master.

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:51.700
Congratulations.

00:09:52.760 --> 00:09:53.930
Thanks.

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:59.740
Though I was only able to become 
one because of you and these two.

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:07.630
You are already a splendid 
tomb guardian, Young Master.

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:11.390
Thank you for everything.

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:15.180
I am very sorry that 
I have to leave, but...

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:22.930
Huh? Hey, wait...

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:27.900
This stage, and my role 
have come to an end.

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:35.400
This is goodbye.

00:10:37.230 --> 00:10:40.330
Farewell, Young Master.

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:46.870
I wish you luck in battle.

00:10:50.860 --> 00:10:52.230
Shostia...

00:10:57.070 --> 00:11:00.980
I was wondering who I'd be up against and 
apparently it's just a little baby.

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:03.720
Wh-Who are you?

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:07.050
This guy's the last tomb guardian?

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:09.810
Don't make me laugh!

00:11:10.110 --> 00:11:12.890
Listen up and remember this well.

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:15.520
You're not the last guardian...

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:19.150
It's me!

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:04.930
Next Time
Suigin Learns to Play the Grave Robbing Game!

00:13:02.390 --> 00:13:03.810
The Silver Guardian!
